    {
      "type": "post",
      "id": "7437105309875183616",
      "entityId": "7437105309875183616",
      "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/yonathan-levy_linkedin-rewards-the-people-who-understand-activity-7437105309875183616-v30x",
      "shareLinkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7437105308822384640",
      "shareUrn": "urn:li:share:7437105308822384640",
      "content": "LinkedIn rewards the people who understand how it works.\n\nHere is what the data shows:\n\n54% of people find you through your posts.\n30% through your comments.\n15% through network recommendations.\nLess than 1% through search.\n\nComment strategically. Every sharp comment is a profile visit waiting to happen.\n\nBeyond that:\n\n- Your best post from 90 days ago is new to 40% of your current followers. Repost it.\n- Reddit, your DMs, Grok - your audience is telling you exactly what to post about. You just have to look.\n- Design for mobile first. One idea per slide. High contrast and large text.\n- Batch your content. Collect, write, build visuals, schedule - all in one system.\n\nThe people growing fast on LinkedIn run a better system.",
